    "title": "Match Pair 3D - Matching Game",
    "description": "Match Pair 3D - Matching Puzzle Game is a challenging matching game. The game has tons of challenging well-designed levels to train your brain and exercise your logical thinking and memory. It is the best food for your brain!\r\n\r\nMatch Pair 3D has fully enjoyed the collection of various 3D objects Cute Animals \ud83d\udc36, Lovely Toys \ud83e\uddf8, Fresh Fruits  \ud83c\udf47 , Delicious Cakes \ud83e\uddc1, Beautiful Accessories \ud83d\udc8d, Cool Vehicles \ud83d\ude97, etc. You can find your favorite object on each level! \r\n \r\nHOW TO PLAY?\r\n\ud83d\udd39Blow your mind and match 2 similar numbers of objects. As you crush all 3D objects to finish the game quickly before time runs out. You Win !\r\n\ud83d\udd39Make several successful matches to get combo Streaks.\r\n\ud83d\udd39Use the HINT button to auto-find a pair.\r\n\ud83d\udd39Match Pair 3D - Match 3D objects easy to play for everyone!\r\n \r\nGAME FEATURES\r\n* Challenging levels to keep you entertained\r\n* Shiny 3D visual effects and objects\r\n* Collect stars to earn rewards\r\n* Hint boosters to help you out\r\n* Auto-save your progress so you can pick up where you left off\r\n* Play games anytime, anywhere! \r\n* Task focus and concentration enhanced\r\n\r\nPlay Match Pair 3D every day to improve memory speed and relieve stress. Such a simple and cool application to relax and pump observation. What else is needed?\r\nTry to download and play now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Match Pair 3D - Matching Puzzle Game is a challenging matching game. The game has tons of challenging well-designed levels to train your brain and exercise your logical thinking and memory. It is the best food for your brain!<br><br>Match Pair 3D has fully enjoyed the collection of various 3D objects Cute Animals \ud83d\udc36, Lovely Toys \ud83e\uddf8, Fresh Fruits  \ud83c\udf47 , Delicious Cakes \ud83e\uddc1, Beautiful Accessories \ud83d\udc8d, Cool Vehicles \ud83d\ude97, etc. You can find your favorite object on each level! <br> <br>HOW TO PLAY?<br>\ud83d\udd39Blow your mind and match 2 similar numbers of objects. As you crush all 3D objects to finish the game quickly before time runs out. You Win !<br>\ud83d\udd39Make several successful matches to get combo Streaks.<br>\ud83d\udd39Use the HINT button to auto-find a pair.<br>\ud83d\udd39Match Pair 3D - Match 3D objects easy to play for everyone!<br> <br>GAME FEATURES<br>* Challenging levels to keep you entertained<br>* Shiny 3D visual effects and objects<br>* Collect stars to earn rewards<br>* Hint boosters to help you out<br>* Auto-save your progress so you can pick up where you left off<br>* Play games anytime, anywhere! <br>* Task focus and concentration enhanced<br><br>Play Match Pair 3D every day to improve memory speed and relieve stress. Such a simple and cool application to relax and pump observation. What else is needed?<br>Try to download and play now!",
